{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02099",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.74,
      "end_seconds": 6.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.58,
      "text": "Welcome. Make yourself comfortable. Okay, start wherever you like, I'm listening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.23,
      "end_seconds": 15.91,
      "duration_seconds": 8.68,
      "text": "Mainly cramping in my calves when I walk. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.63,
      "end_seconds": 30.04,
      "duration_seconds": 9.41,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.79,
      "end_seconds": 63.44,
      "duration_seconds": 31.65,
      "text": "I, I'd say mild. I get some relief from stopping. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. Yeah, I've also had a slow-healing toe sore, for about a month. With slow-healing toe sore, pretty mild, if I'm being honest. I did have hair loss on my shins at one point, but that's gone now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.49,
      "end_seconds": 73.29,
      "duration_seconds": 7.8,
      "text": "So, have you had cramping in your calves when you walk before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.08,
      "end_seconds": 80.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "I had a similar thing last winter. It went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.66,
      "end_seconds": 86.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.35,
      "end_seconds": 98.51,
      "duration_seconds": 11.16,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother. Not much, I mostly stay in these days. I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.83,
      "end_seconds": 103.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.8,
      "end_seconds": 107.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.63,
      "end_seconds": 119.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.5,
      "end_seconds": 126.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "No surgery, um, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.17,
      "end_seconds": 143.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.78,
      "end_seconds": 149.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "I've had high cholesterol, yes. I've got diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.04,
      "end_seconds": 161.54,
      "duration_seconds": 10.5,
      "text": "Understood. Okay, I can see high cholesterol and diabetes in your file as well. Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.19,
      "end_seconds": 164.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Simvastatin, 20 milligrams, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.71,
      "end_seconds": 170.71,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "Any pain at rest, back pain, chest pain or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.35,
      "end_seconds": 173.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "No, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.13,
      "end_seconds": 181.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.29,
      "end_seconds": 186.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "That's normal as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.78,
      "end_seconds": 191.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.19,
      "end_seconds": 200.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.52,
      "end_seconds": 222.89,
      "duration_seconds": 7.37,
      "text": "Okay: pulse 84, saturation 97 percent. And BP is 110 over 78, temperature is 36.4 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.78,
      "end_seconds": 227.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Is that alright, uh, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.63,
      "end_seconds": 232.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "I'll interpret them after the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.61,
      "end_seconds": 238.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 247.98,
      "end_seconds": 249.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.14,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.44,
      "end_seconds": 252.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.19,
      "end_seconds": 277.38,
      "duration_seconds": 6.19,
      "text": "The pulses at the left foot are absent and the foot is cool and shiny."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.8,
      "end_seconds": 296.35,
      "duration_seconds": 14.55,
      "text": "All finished, thank you. So where does that leave us? It's hard to say. Peripheral arterial disease is one possibility and a nerve problem another, and I'd rather not commit yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.64,
      "end_seconds": 299.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.36,
      "end_seconds": 313.47,
      "duration_seconds": 12.11,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with peripheral arterial disease do well once it's treated properly. Let's book a cholesterol test to look into arterial disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 314.87,
      "end_seconds": 322.18,
      "duration_seconds": 7.31,
      "text": "Do I need an ultrasound of the leg arteries? I read it might help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.61,
      "end_seconds": 330.29,
      "duration_seconds": 6.68,
      "text": "I wouldn't order it today. If anything changes, we'll reconsider. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.74,
      "end_seconds": 335.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.06,
      "end_seconds": 339.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Okay, goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}